{
  "schema_version": 1,
  "batch": 933,
  "batch_count": 1655,
  "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
  "source_commit": "9c226cba1af606e532633417d9bfcf7f7d66a4bf",
  "source_language": "zh-CN",
  "entries": [
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:5d18107edd49be077fd78071",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "比赛终盘开始时若身处中间集团以后\\n则加速力提升,并且视野稍微变广\\n＜作战・居中＞",
      "source_fingerprint": "e35049cd2fe500594675f07c25e7e3d91f1501426bfafc3cff8860b4327a2f04",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "48",
        "104001211"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:e1ce7bff59401812b95e9ec0",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "比赛中盘初段位于队伍中后方时\\n提升加速度,并在比赛剩余200m的位置\\n稍微提升速度＜作战・居中＞",
      "source_fingerprint": "789a524f7c89cf19e0bab50dc631970202fa03d5df346bac73ea2f4d07482f0f",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "48",
        "104001221"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:f4e0f4b394f02e6f64b14e65",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "比赛序盘时若身处后方\\n则前方赛马娘的行为变得迟钝\\n并且稍微回复自己的持久力＜英里＞",
      "source_fingerprint": "1c073ffc2f42477b090fbaf9ae61a263150e147b388b995b46829cfadff91093",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "48",
        "104002111"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:1390faa237a6b74b9eca1d7f",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "临近比赛中盘时若身处中团以后的位置,则回复持久力,并稍微提升速度\\n＜作战・居中＞",
      "source_fingerprint": "d59b7277051e30bf7157c04a050c852eff9fd5b1a8a0a6be84ec0a14ad12e5c2",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "48",
        "104002211"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:675426d08331087127afe83e",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "比赛中盘消耗少量耐力\\n使速度极大提升,技能发动时\\n若位于中间位置,则不消耗耐力\\n＜作战・居中＞",
      "source_fingerprint": "4a2e3b5b451e36d01aac7e59a4111e5ba13946b2b4fd7203bd64c261c4040775",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "48",
        "104003111"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:cdf2457e212d0bfcda2ca742",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "力量十二分强劲时,在比赛中盘大幅向前突进\\n若技能发动时处于中后方\\n则变为极大幅向前突进＜作战・居中＞",
      "source_fingerprint": "82d89483d1487b7bfacfcdcc649552fc4a9559ba4dbe2e296eb8319bb7ac7150",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "48",
        "104003211"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:c84e7957605618d9ae8433ad",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "比赛终盘时提升加速度\\n并且稍微提升速度＜短距离＞",
      "source_fingerprint": "c8ad045a3750447312e1383acd0efb4b5c66af7f307b1d11b63dac627bb48f80",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "48",
        "104101111"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:1267bc381581a6413cdb1abc",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "比赛中盘时若是以巨大差距保持领先\\n则大幅提升速度＜短距离＞",
      "source_fingerprint": "4256750caf550f0cb0a683bde5b573ad4f09e681d3c9e24c474d3dc404dea00b",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "48",
        "104101211"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:b1d78602ac58384002e774db",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "临近比赛终盘时处于前方\\n则速度大幅上升＜短距离＞",
      "source_fingerprint": "c2ed72475755f1b7ce095abe0ed5ccca4f0183a7d781c2e8eee0a64d0466e58c",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "48",
        "104102111"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:1eea302cbd261cb56aa9a1f8",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "在直线一段时间内向前突进＜短距离＞",
      "source_fingerprint": "8b464e4e01a64c511036c6ae48880097d7fa1b29db78131c45f1331cdeeacbb0",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "48",
        "104102211"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:fd10a69e0cf42a483adcb207",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "比赛开始时稍微向前突进\\n之后准备超越或被贴近时\\n向前突进＜短距离＞",
      "source_fingerprint": "3832896c8ec9740e0a474026341855f78a83e12c55dfe5318a4df53b242973ca",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "48",
        "104103111"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:1bd947a1db67dcf2bcb72159",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "在比赛终盘初段更早时间内处于领先,\\n或在前方准备超越时,亦或\\n在终盘初段更早时间内处于前方时\\n加速力提升＜短距离＞",
      "source_fingerprint": "71ec9777116b45b10546936033ca11c4e728279655cba73eb35c05edd6b4961d",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "48",
        "104103211"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:deded42261b4476389513ac5",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "比赛后半段处于前列进行名次争夺时\\n发挥爆进之力,速度加快",
      "source_fingerprint": "2ca029c93cf0b16a5d21764c4ad0dadc7a969dd72f0d4dcaea09c2b7f1fd3567",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "48",
        "10411"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:77a7321570ae4b80313b38ff",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "身处直线时速度提升\\n并稍微向前突进\\n＜短距离/英里＞",
      "source_fingerprint": "c9ba273350fe2c2024ca176e0e20e3b446ff0ed86bddd4a32d9fc6fe26a02144",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "48",
        "104201111"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:52a53b264b6f7f024025b482",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "进行赶超时\\n一段时间内速度持续提升\\n＜短距离/英里＞",
      "source_fingerprint": "4cb9eb345d301eeec7f6b7048b9653361e381f5a33523d9e986eadb5c379cf21",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "48",
        "104201211"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:a60178068989d48fe98ae445",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "在终盘的直线上提升加速度并稍微提升速度\\n若是东京赛场则在终盘初期的直线上\\n提升加速度并稍微提升速度\\n＜短距离/英里＞",
      "source_fingerprint": "f9ef49ce95f5ffc12249435d1546e19c4763fcdf8b1ac93cafb5bd6a0584b59b",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "48",
        "104202111"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:4cc50e83a835e1fe466c3ea8",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "在比赛中盘的弯道一段时间内速度少量提升\\n若技能发动时自身位于最终弯道\\n则变为一段时间内速度大幅提升\\n＜短距离/英里＞",
      "source_fingerprint": "9ae24af137ae4ab367211a77bdae0069f87394d428f8c089ad24c06d30e93550",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "48",
        "104202211"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:388f11d40c222ca86148aba4",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "若最终冲刺时位于前方\\n则速度大幅提升＜沙土＞",
      "source_fingerprint": "ded9e74de7cdcac71d9344df4038662b2046eac2c5230a3e4d10eb2f4f374795",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "48",
        "104301111"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:9acfb8cd8925023c95f4978a",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "擅长状态为重或是不良时的赛道\\n速度与力量大幅提升\\n＜沙土＞",
      "source_fingerprint": "c66b220713c5841f8a7c9bfa9761cc7ad446ec8303ae810fa300cf58da833ca9",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "48",
        "104301211"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:9687a2904ee6f3bb10944fa9",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "速度和力量稍微提升\\n若是在「重」或者「不良」马场状态下\\n所有基础能力略微提升＜沙土＞",
      "source_fingerprint": "e54d827f06246fc36750984f51d1d1d9eb1350b66639b7f566d358a9a4b2ee5b",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "48",
        "104301221"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:796984bd3c13826d222a4d4f",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "临近比赛中盘的某处\\n一段时间内速度提升\\n＜作战・先行＞",
      "source_fingerprint": "c3417aee0cec805625d6d7ea8b381f8f7f7846327615d693db89de5f3f1218a1",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "48",
        "104302111"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:05fc75f935313a750908b6cf",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "若正后方长时间有赛马娘紧跟\\n则一段时间内速度提升＜泥地＞",
      "source_fingerprint": "b29bc8d7f442a19ac91483e5801c1bd2f0010ac210a4649e57867c7d7fa2e377",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "48",
        "104302211"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:f6b30a6f5a466ad4fb6423c6",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "身处下坡时,回复持久力\\n并且稍微提升速度＜作战・追赶＞",
      "source_fingerprint": "a5de52679dfeaee4d7ebf6736820e13b655ea44c9d55e3981305cde5070b0527",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "48",
        "104401111"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:894e2d2c3c5a70c6e1f40853",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "比赛终盘时若位于第二名之后的位置\\n则稍微向前突进,并让紧盯的\\n赛马娘感到紧张＜作战・追赶＞",
      "source_fingerprint": "59eb2a857a5aae82abd769867b4e6da9e065a6daf7bb6aac3dde3dccfa859b55",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "48",
        "104401211"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:9743506be2d8ea349efcf33d",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "比赛终盘一段时间内向前突进\\n＜作战・追赶＞",
      "source_fingerprint": "fae01b3bca3205380c1b06ef712eddb1cd1d6da5ca1018d5d61991ab3131796e",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "48",
        "104401221"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:496db3b6bfa785f782b208ed",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "比赛终盘初段提升加速度\\n若是2200m比赛则消耗少量体力\\n使加速度在终盘初段更早时间内大幅提升\\n＜作战・追赶＞",
      "source_fingerprint": "f51bed33613e3c59ae74b7eb9bc2b1598f5fc78e21c9cf1ab78e1ccc5d1bc4f4",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "48",
        "104402111"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:e3022538df48d7038dad99e0",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "在终盘初期更早时间内少量提升加速度\\n如果是2000m比赛,则消耗少量耐力\\n小幅向前突进＜追赶・中距离＞",
      "source_fingerprint": "ae0eaacf4d9e3639f138700a80137cb17c2285d5adcf85340443b7bb3865744b",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "48",
        "104402121"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:703a6a469058356d233be6b4",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "比赛中盘消耗少量体力\\n使速度大幅提升\\n之后在终盘的最终直线处速度稍微提升\\n＜作战・追赶＞",
      "source_fingerprint": "286975fffe6ef23fa800d792bb487a540fb1788a4dfee5f54d82f83d06b3782f",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "48",
        "104402211"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:2f23553277316b4c65622c4e",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "比赛终盘时若身处前方\\n则一段时间内速度持续提升\\n＜作战・先行＞",
      "source_fingerprint": "716cdf4f2cbda393a3094d346a2ccaa0ad5c082d248021dde457f4c7549350ef",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "48",
        "104501111"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:d2200e9ca78abaf0a83559af",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "以利落的动作过弯\\n大幅回复持久力",
      "source_fingerprint": "126625a9be697ca6650d16aecf6b7b8c5b58a8f31a2447a7ed3f7baa8d04532c",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "48",
        "104501211"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:0f40762135bdb9d553ec23c3",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "身处弯道上时速度提升\\n并且稍微回复持久力",
      "source_fingerprint": "44cef8905337120752f00d6edb61878cbae9fe25c274860a9766eff1e874ac80",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "48",
        "104502111"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:19c078bf8ab5a796d1410540",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "比赛中盘遭遇前方拥堵时\\n稍微回复持久力\\n并且剥夺前方赛马娘的持久力＜中距离＞",
      "source_fingerprint": "424e5e81ee8cb0abf0130837f01924fe5917484bc786ab6f805306bca7904a77",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "48",
        "104502211"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:5e0dc097e17e6adaf532ca58",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "比赛中盘速度大幅提升\\n＜作战・先行＞",
      "source_fingerprint": "532441ffd6df5e734df32a163f586752bae36dacc65ee3149c2e8aba947318da",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "48",
        "104503111"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:457fffaa5ff94b43c99451d1",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "临近终盘位于领头或是\\n距离领头6马身以内时\\n在终盘提升加速度＜先行・长距离＞",
      "source_fingerprint": "2b2068bb03c8a7274e6b0085e09b62daf3f72e5a46ce11ab73051af0301d5587",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "48",
        "104503211"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:f7a90cbd16da5354cebce161",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "在比赛中盘处于好位置时\\n持久力回复",
      "source_fingerprint": "6e840da6f513589eb3f91d109657894e66fbd62c08de278830ffa1e9337503bd",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "48",
        "10451"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:3d240c7598a924ca60a6cba5",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "比赛序盘的一段时间内\\n赛道的选择变得更加明智",
      "source_fingerprint": "e625871e1b96e643e2d43495c057c82ad879629ff9ad5cfd85abe30f3a61b70c",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "48",
        "104601111"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:3e538fa90c85e273024c8981",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "比赛终盘的一段时间内,稍微向前突进",
      "source_fingerprint": "b91490d3aa68be29247fa1f6c1aa914e0876ffc507d5b61a7195f109d5055162",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "48",
        "104601121"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:060f324aa3f47f6fcc6a9b8f",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "比赛中盘进行名次争夺时速度提升\\n并且稍微回复持久力＜沙土＞",
      "source_fingerprint": "3a27bcd9ecb93bd76f83e267033cc3c2b10ba925dff451cf8de77c53a86b6532",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "48",
        "104601211"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:d5bf9e997791d61577072892",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "比赛中盘进行名次争夺时速度提升\\n并且稍微回复持久力＜沙土＞",
      "source_fingerprint": "3a27bcd9ecb93bd76f83e267033cc3c2b10ba925dff451cf8de77c53a86b6532",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "48",
        "104602111"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:defcc1d7956b17aa48b4ad2a",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "在比赛中盘进行名次争夺时\\n速度大幅提升＜沙土＞",
      "source_fingerprint": "96305d04978934cf370d03a79281fa1f717502da12b80e56d04dff7167355f19",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "48",
        "104602121"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:aa540133fd9808cc6394a04b",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "比赛终盘时若身处前方\\n则加速力大幅提升＜沙土＞",
      "source_fingerprint": "b2de559362d11c25afac39f289e0aea3239a840d0a74836e5700e0bb095e4f1f",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "48",
        "104602211"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:316ee7644b8b8c66febd4b50",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "起跑时晚起跑的时间减少\\n并稍微提升加速度",
      "source_fingerprint": "07649f659a8643d156a98e39d75aee769129ab7f0697256723b0b73dc295f9a0",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "48",
        "104603111"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:404c6af5b76bf1c1158f0fd5",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "比赛中盘发动技能时速度提升\\n之后在比赛终盘发动技能时,小幅向前突进\\n并额外提供微量加速度＜逃马・泥地＞",
      "source_fingerprint": "7c76804fbdccb8d05990b76c846bcad910ed92f4594ed2fd794ade70e9c60ffe",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "48",
        "104603211"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:cc1b45b6eb4165358ddeea62",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "比赛中盘时若身处前方\\n则大幅回复持久力\\n＜作战・先行＞",
      "source_fingerprint": "fdf21e7caf36f30669d41a936c00f159b998bcedcd6110c4c5486cf7d428c578",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "48",
        "104701111"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:5b8fc5298cb8acda6318618c",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "比赛中盘位于前方时\\n稍微回复体力并提升速度\\n＜作战・先行＞",
      "source_fingerprint": "efb3e6d14d7880a608cfb58f88e24586721277e89e6eb2f1a96a67be87a79308",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "48",
        "104701121"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:13b49e37a004f3d78f01e53d",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "身处弯道时,速度大幅提升\\n＜中距离/长距离＞",
      "source_fingerprint": "a15f8686be75acfddab450ba42077abd76831cd91d9d9665ea8564a0da447af2",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "48",
        "104701211"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:20591545d1458283dd557a9f",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "在临近比赛终盘的直线上\\n速度大幅提升\\n＜作战・先行＞",
      "source_fingerprint": "292bda2496d1daa6afb1e2a82060b896c9b03f8cc17f17a20fef5cdbc5fe9535",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "48",
        "104702111"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:32b38bd26c649668ab2a9a58",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "擅长秋天和冬天的比赛\\n速度和力量大幅提升",
      "source_fingerprint": "bfdf4b5228dd5cfafc757b854208573392aa44b769b274084d85ceb7f4b55d5c",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "48",
        "104702211"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:ce71c349e5e045c470e18580",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "比赛终盘开始时加速度提升\\n并且稍微回复持久力\\n＜先行/居中＞",
      "source_fingerprint": "f4052fba43fe0b6d66f7223781320faae559284b885aa3f8868294224b8ebd13",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "48",
        "104801111"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:315ab0f31d7156d95c66cef1",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "比赛中盘时回复持久力\\n并稍微提升速度\\n＜先行/居中＞",
      "source_fingerprint": "586816008a896fe1015664470105c7dbfd665bba72bf66c3fe01378858044a77",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "48",
        "104801211"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:5668861b3e5c7d6e368dbd48",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "在最终弯道位于队伍中后方时\\n加速度提升,若是东京竞马场\\n则额外提升少量速度＜中距离＞",
      "source_fingerprint": "ee9e34b3925c323d89d86b0446b9f3332c6e84dcdb6616ad2994a566cdac3c26",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "48",
        "104802111"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:51b5b51954c594de82056ea5",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "在最终弯道位于队伍中间时速度提升\\n若是东京竞马场的中距离比赛\\n则额外稍微提升加速度＜作战・居中＞",
      "source_fingerprint": "138f84619234493d16b29a49f2ca5a3f2557a2dddda0398ce632660bde7e6ea4",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "48",
        "104802211"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:15018a627a9175bbcd0e9510",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "比赛终盘初期位于中间集团时\\n大幅向前突进,若是东京竞马场\\n则以极快速度向前突进＜居中・中距离＞",
      "source_fingerprint": "7492d753c5b9abeb99023a67c61daf04fe57d838643abaf6c8337e539763d5f2",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "48",
        "104802221"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:9a6b4851b310cd8c3fbfd907",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "在比赛中盘的直线上，一段时间内\\n速度会提升，发动技能时\\n若与领头马相距4个马身以上\\n则效果增加＜中距离/长距离＞",
      "source_fingerprint": "6c19b9c3fa56709d4034231170849f62a90730b7813c022f1b0dbabddfc147b1",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "48",
        "104803111"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:dfc5d4f4061000dfa6e305a7",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "在2000m以上的比赛中，于终盘的\\n最终弯道加速力会大幅提升\\n在长距离比赛中效果会改变，变为\\n在一段时间内略微向前冲出＜先行/居中＞",
      "source_fingerprint": "a334e137832adbbaeac80b5ade113ca58b7a4d5e09a1d321d279dde1984411a1",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "48",
        "104803211"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:ff41a32ffc8c8adaf891d998",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "比赛后半阶段时,速度超大幅提升\\n但也有可能同时消耗大幅持久力",
      "source_fingerprint": "91524108568f926d55a6a5bbc316540e9f7606e81610c10dbcf36ca84f455d89",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "48",
        "104901111"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:2dc8d877f9e17116cd7ad496",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "偶尔能在比赛中爆发出更强大的实力\\n速度、力量、根性超大幅提升\\n人气排名越低越容易生效",
      "source_fingerprint": "9ed0658d71cb931b6be2ffb93119bd0a5a901ad00f18ef68b0dd21707fb6ee7b",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "48",
        "104901211"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:1051fdbf8c76160b51f73bdb",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "最终直线位于领头或距离领头4马身以内\n时速度大幅提升，此外\n中距离比赛且在终盘有过超越的话\n则稍微向前突进<作战·居中>",
      "source_fingerprint": "0f4133fcd37fa857499e68419db25869060d747ccbe40f87459cdc86d8abbdd6",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "48",
        "104902111"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:e64a0664fd100425df411787",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "比赛中盘迫近时\n稍微降低速度\n之后在比赛终盘初期\n极大向前突进<中距离/长距离>",
      "source_fingerprint": "c322cafca620f3bb089ea924c6b3dd95465ef1dd83c8f20e79a9a84cedaef725",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "48",
        "104902211"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:235cfd0260311708d95f0746",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "比赛终盘时若身处接近最后方的位置\\n则回复持久力,并稍微提升速度\\n＜作战・追赶＞",
      "source_fingerprint": "809a7d665706bed119143f43cd9cb449494394a6e0fe60acd61986275c04cb39",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "48",
        "105001111"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:517e81bcf7cc8b69b5fc26ac",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "最后冲刺时若身处直线\\n大幅提升加速度\\n并且视野变得稍微广阔＜作战・追赶＞",
      "source_fingerprint": "fdd433095376904c1235d604dd3dc9eb746c0cacc629b4be5401683dada48241",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "48",
        "105001211"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:37a2037c4f84ae7c1c285a93",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "比赛中盘位于后方时,一段时间内速度提升\\n并选择更好的路线\\n＜作战・追赶＞",
      "source_fingerprint": "62d0f5bf8f3bd22d8fe2b99832502a01b46f285e241d576d4224badbc55d8cce",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "48",
        "105002111"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:ef9934f21e88937ea6ca8fdc",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "比赛终盘时开始时若身处中团以后的位置\\n则一段时间内加速度持续提升＜中距离＞",
      "source_fingerprint": "665274135698d39bc5596f9be296f082a7cdea51f9da3511ef972a6b9d737566",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "48",
        "105002211"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:3727000e900706fe05c98857",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "临近终盘时若位于中后方\\n则一段时间内速度提升\\n＜作战・追赶＞",
      "source_fingerprint": "ef9166838b1ca484eda94c55bdf7c8081f2cc7cb9806820c18495b14aa1d1248",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "48",
        "105003111"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:0cf7e60383b316ddd029ea72",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "最终直线处在第二名开外\\n且与领头距离4马身以内时\\n速度极大提升＜作战・追赶＞",
      "source_fingerprint": "379b7524efce91f88f0e6f2e874e0a9d2d27818b6e2e57c1acdf167f4806b26c",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "48",
        "105003211"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:b787ebd0cfdd6d1dc7e71297",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "若为中山赛马场,则在终盘时加速度\\n稍微提升,若在即将进入终盘时与领头\\n相距6马身以上\\n则加速度提升＜追赶・中距离＞",
      "source_fingerprint": "a44e1355880a7daf87e726254db018cf2036433ba30e3a8e0c19fa377de704f0",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "48",
        "105003221"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:6f90048f510c95c79337fccd",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "身处直线时速度提升\\n并且稍微恢复持久力",
      "source_fingerprint": "953ecc57e86d409159e742c3bf68e2ebeb77073d5bc7c7ae468a2171d73182bf",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "48",
        "105101111"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:caa29f0ab97560fc6e27465a",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "直线上速度大幅提升\t",
      "source_fingerprint": "6da0b422a7dbafd03353f3bbee4a099b4513d3647045de9708c82e46d90b81c1",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "48",
        "105101121"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:8a1dfb7d7d68484cd51ec34d",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "身处下坡时,加速力提升\\n＜作战・先行＞",
      "source_fingerprint": "e3a8830a3f9bc71f388b1c15ccfa241a32e15411d99a19be309c520e1f75f438",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "48",
        "105101211"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:dc41187a17a534533dc5c074",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "在弯道处速度提升\\n并使除自身外的己方队伍成员\\n速度稍微提升＜英里＞",
      "source_fingerprint": "e13406aee6bfe987d7a0ed72d4691d1c619eed6fa6cebcc5056588b6f99164b4",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "48",
        "105102111"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:9adc5ce7facf26037ab4a693",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "下坡时速度提升\\n并稍微提升加速度\\n＜短距离/英里＞",
      "source_fingerprint": "2dc74cd2dd15995c96781159a9dd370515b9aad86ba5a3c15d0e06ada6c99bad",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "48",
        "105102211"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:cd8cb657b0267a2ad04ef7f8",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "下坡时速度大幅提升\\n并使除自己外的队伍成员\\n速度稍微提升＜英里＞",
      "source_fingerprint": "428fd9c951709a421c1dd8ad348cf566feacf366dad10013a70569cc43ccbf91",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "48",
        "105102221"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:a95856a3730022de78201caf",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "在比赛序盘或是中盘时前方被阻挡时\\n大幅回复持久力\\n同时跑道选择更加明智",
      "source_fingerprint": "87f1b85cec4fcf010b9f9f55db2673f137d9112dd7f55c30278e6df243773ed2",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "48",
        "105201111"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:3b509070d015e302ad57b3d8",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "比赛中盘完成超越时\\n回复持久力,并且稍微提升速度",
      "source_fingerprint": "0af972d32580e4988abafa2f2290446fd76ff98b4bccb7d378ac8b63f918f9a4",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "48",
        "105201211"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:035e52bf0861b4289af4ef33",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "比赛序盘时\\n跑道的选择变得非常明智\\n并且速度稍微提升",
      "source_fingerprint": "4d691aeb3987ac2c40f97fa133b2dc16709e994be32b6a3911475b38adeb8b3d",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "48",
        "105202111"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:36c9b16fe20bf6c1f0f0e0fe",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "比赛终盘路线选择更加明智\\n并提升少量加速度",
      "source_fingerprint": "1171e911d8475f6a4f52b9a90f266aaa6531f348c62e328865caada55c2286a8",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "48",
        "105202121"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:f302b57caf666f02859546ea",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "完成超越时,一段时间内\\n加速力持续小幅提升\\n并且稍微提升速度＜作战・居中＞",
      "source_fingerprint": "547ad226ba1ee04961494f10e6699099a304aa0c57511cf4edcd92048ad05715",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "48",
        "105202211"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:575583e0e8ae96723d6e2ee2",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "在最终弯道处于靠后位置时\\n会看着附近的赛马娘并恢复持久力",
      "source_fingerprint": "e471b891cacb2cbbcfe4543d6365658e0c3f76fbd05132f0a15e3e1bf506e293",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "48",
        "10521"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:83028112d83b0a7870748224",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "在最终弯道外侧完成超越时\\n速度提升并稍微提升加速度\\n＜作战・居中＞",
      "source_fingerprint": "e1244795b934a13012886113ab6c1dbf6f29df3348df0a5cc29da802610e5b8e",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "48",
        "105301111"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:62e22ad2a8c94c8d5800f945",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "在最终弯道进行超越时\\n一段时间内向前突进\\n＜居中・英里＞",
      "source_fingerprint": "631412d7f86417a936207a4034eef623e23a63f55e50d6e669026138bd32ed48",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "48",
        "105301121"
      ]
    }
  ]
}
